# Store and check out text files with LF line endings on every machine.
# Why: golden/seeded/build.py must give byte-identical diffs on Windows and Linux; with Windows'
# default CRLF conversion, a fresh checkout would change every generated diff. Also silences the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.png binary
